        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge the bullets! Strike to the rhythm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MoriyaRhythm is a Touhou Project fan game that fuses bullet hell and rhythm action into one colorful experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pop and Cute!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adorable characters, dazzling danmaku, and upbeat music—</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >enjoy them all at once!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hit to the Beat!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Timing is everything in this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen closely to the music and feel the rhythm!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dodge the Danmaku!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just like in the original series, waves of beautiful bullets will come your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between big and small jumps to weave through the patterns!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Easy to Try, Fun to Master</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stage lasts only a few dozen seconds,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >so you can practice and retry as much as you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you’re skilled at both rhythm and danmaku,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >aim for no damage and full combo runs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfaction guaranteed!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge the bullets! Strike to the rhythm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MoriyaRhythm is a Touhou Project fan game that fuses bullet hell and rhythm action into one colorful experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pop and Cute!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adorable characters, dazzling danmaku, and upbeat music—</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >enjoy them all at once!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hit to the Beat!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Timing is everything in this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen closely to the music and feel the rhythm!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dodge the Danmaku!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just like in the original series, waves of beautiful bullets will come your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between big and small jumps to weave through the patterns!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Easy to Try, Fun to Master</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stage lasts only a few dozen seconds,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >so you can practice and retry as much as you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you’re skilled at both rhythm and danmaku,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >aim for no damage and full combo runs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfaction guaranteed!</p>",
